### This dataset repository contains de-identified fMRI and T1-weighted imaging data acquired from 16 Parkinson's disease patients (aged 50-76 years) receiving deep brain stimulation therapy. All patients were implanted in either the subthalamic nucleus or the globus pallidus internus.

### Data Acquisition
- For details on data acquisition, please refer to the attached JSON files below.

